%h4 Available Catalogs
%p click name to show all pics in catalog
.list
  - if @list.empty?
    %p There are no catalogs to show; select something to load.
  - else
    - xleft = @list.length.div(2)
    = render partial: 'list_column', :locals => {:mylist => @list[0..xleft-1]}
    = render partial: 'list_column', :locals => {:mylist => @list[xleft..@list.length-1]}
